// Part 27: thermodynamics and heat, nuclear physics, hydrogen, and the world
// wars. Requested as one batch, so it covers four unrelated subjects; the four
// new categories exist only because of it.
//
// The thermodynamics half is deliberately weighted towards the laws and their
// consequences — the zeroth through third law, entropy, free energies, the
// Carnot theorem — rather than towards applications, and then towards phase
// change and freezing specifically, since that was the second thing asked for.
//
// Every URL below returned 200 from this network. A number of excellent
// primary-source archives for the war material could not be included because
// they are unreachable from here: hyperwar.org, avalon.law.yale.edu,
// history.army.mil, loc.gov, europeana.eu and osti.gov all fail DNS or return
// 403. They are real and worth adding from an unblocked network; guessing a
// path into them was not an option.
